    rdfs:label "Calendar"@en ;
    skos:definition "A major space for time-based notes."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "- Scheduled events and sessions for time periods: Day, Week, Quarter, and Year.\n- Parent context for clusters of notes by time horizon.\n- Calendar is a major space for time-based linked notes in Obsidian Ideaverse vault in a PKM system, as well as a synced Neo4j subgraph within a PKM knowledge graph.\n- Supported by API routes, Python services, scripts, and agents, as well as Swift apps, intents, widgets, shortcuts, and Siri.\n- Also represented by Calendar and Fantastical apps."@en ;
    skos:changeNote "Removed redundant Calendar2 created by Proposals tab when it already existed."@en, "2026-08-25 — Created from approved proposal (proposed by Doug Warren) (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-26 — Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-26 — Definition updated; Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Unmarked as a top concept; Parent “Calendar Folder” added (by Doug Warren)" ;
