    skos:scopeNote "- Includes properties about the book, author, publisher, etc.\n- Created with a Book Template, and metadata captured by the Obsidian Book Search plugin.\n- Query book using book title, author, publisher, or ISBN\n- Uses Google Books API to get the book information and cover image for the Book note.\n- Includes properties for title, subtitle, authors, categories, description, publisher, total pages, cover URL small cover URL, local cover image, publishDate, and ISBN."@en ;
