    skos:scopeNote "The underlying triple model that SKOS and OWL are built on; pkm-vocab.export.ttl is serialized RDF in Turtle syntax."@en ;
    skos:changeNote "2026-08-27 — Unmarked as a top concept; Parent “Standard” added (by Doug Warren)", "Add missing definition and scope notes as initial placeholder content to review refine, and evolve further."@en, "2026-08-28 — Parent “W3C Standard” added (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-28 — Definition added; Scope note added (by Doug Warren)" ;
