    skos:changeNote "Added definition and scope notes for Obsidian Settings."@en, "2026-08-29 — Term created under “Vault” (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “NewConcept” to “ObsidianSettings”; Preferred label “Obsidian Settings@en” added (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Definition added; Scope note added (by Doug Warren)" ;
