pkmv:KnowledgeSystemArchitecture a skos:Concept ;
    skos:narrower pkmv:KnowledgeSystem ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Knowledge System Architecture"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Knowledge System Architecture"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "KSA"@en ;
    skos:definition "A PKM system that integrates Obsidian Notes, Neo4j Graph Database, Claude AI, and diabetes websites with Swift and Python APIs, services, scripts, commands, and agents."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "- Includes a Diabetes AI coach with Morning Review agents that produce Day Diabetes, Day Diabetes Analysis, and Day Analysis every morning to finalize the Day Review for the previous day. "@en ;
    skos:changeNote "Added definition and scope notes for KSA."@en, "2026-08-29 — Term created (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “NewConcept” to “KnowledgeSystemArchitecture”; Preferred label “Knowledge System Architecture@en” added; Alternative label “KSA@en” added; Definition added; Scope note added (by Doug Warren)" ;
