pkmv:Base a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Base"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Base"@en ;
    skos:definition "A database with table, grid, or list views of a collection of notes with selected properties and formulas with associated query filters, group, and sort criteria.."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "- Provides multiple views with different query crtieria, which can be selected as embedded bases in view or canvas notes.\n- Enables CSV export from a base for integration with other apps such as Neo4j as well as Swift and Python apps, services, scripts, commands, or agents."@en ;
    skos:changeNote "Added definition and scope notes for a Base."@en, "2026-08-29 — Duplicated from “Note” (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “NoteCopy” to “Base”; Preferred label changed from “Note@en” to “Base@en”; Definition updated; Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)" ;
