    rdfs:label "Dataview"@en ;
    skos:definition "An Obsidian query language for filtering, sorting, and extracting data from Markdown pages."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "- Obsidian code blocks define Dataview (or DataviewJS) queries that render dynamic content in notes when viewed.\n- More generalized features are now available with Obsidian Bases."@en ;
    skos:changeNote "Added definition and scope notes for Dataview."@en, "2026-08-29 — Duplicated from “Templater” (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “TemplaterCopy” to “Dataview”; Preferred label changed from “Templater@en” to “Dataview@en”; Definition updated; Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)" ;
