pkmv:QuickAdd a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/pkm/vocab> ;
    skos:prefLabel "QuickAdd"@en ;
    rdfs:label "QuickAdd"@en ;
    skos:definition "Extension for Obsidian that includes additional tools (choices): templates, captures, macros, and multis."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "- Templates define how to create a new note using Templater; for example, allows definition of a quick action that creates a new note in a specific location, with a templatized title, and templated content.\n- A capture allows you to quickly add content to predefined files, like adding a link to an open file to a Day cluster note under a particular section.\n- Macros allow you to combine captures and templates into a chained workflow, often using an assigned hotkey.\n- Multi choices are organizational so you can have folders of other choices.\n- QuickAdd format syntax is available for all choices."@en ;
    skos:changeNote "Added definition and scope notes for Dataview."@en, "2026-08-29 — Duplicated from “Dataview” (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “DataviewCopy” to “QuickAdd”; Preferred label changed from “Dataview@en” to “QuickAdd@en”; Definition updated; Scope note updated (by Doug Warren)" ;
