    skos:changeNote "Added definition and scope notes for Health Data."@en, "2026-08-29 — Term created (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Renamed from “NewConcept” to “HealthData”; Preferred label “Health Data@en” added; Definition added; Scope note added (by Doug Warren)", "2026-08-29 — Related term “PKM Python Services” added; Related term “PKM Python Scripts” added; Related term “PKM Python Commands” added (by Doug Warren)" ;
